      "F21": "Tumor arrangement in large clusters with diffuse sheets invading the smooth muscle fibers is characteristic of aggressive neoplasms like urothelial carcinoma or leiomyosarcoma.",
      "F22": "Pleomorphism, nuclear hyperchromasia, and mitoses are features of malignant tumors, supporting diagnoses like urothelial carcinoma, leiomyosarcoma, or malignant granular cell tumor.",
      "F24": "S-100 positivity is more commonly associated with tumors of neural or melanocytic origin, but in the context of the bladder, it could suggest a malignant granular cell tumor, which is S-100 positive."
